<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND'S 13 FOR SECOND ASHES TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND'S 13 FOR SECOND ASHES TEST.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>England named the following 13 on Sunday for the second Ashes test against Australia starting at Lord's on Thursday:</p>
<p>Michael Atherton (captain), Mark Butcher, Alec Stewart, Nasser Hussain, Graham Thorpe, John Crawley, Mark Ealham, Robert Croft, Darren Gough, Andy Caddick, Devon Malcolm, Adam Hollioake, Phil Tufnell.</p>
</text>
